OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opens for A1(M) murder
OL,4,Acrash victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has opened into the death of
OL,7,Fwoman who was killed in a crash on the
OL,8,FA1(M) in North Yorkshire.
OL,10,FElena Lacramioara Chiriac, 22, from
OL,11,FNewcastle, died when a silver Ford
OL,12,FTransit and a silver Volkswagen Golf
OL,13,Fcollided on the southbound carriageway
OL,14,Fon 4 October in the Barton area, north
OL,15,Fof Scotch Corner.
OL,17,FOn Thursday, North Yorkshire Coroner's
OL,18,FCourt heard she was pronounced dead at
OL,19,Fthe scene with her provisional cause of
OL,20,Fdeath said to be as a result of head
OL,21,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
