OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opens for A1(M) murder
OL,4,Acrash victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a brief hearing, Assistant
OL,7,FCoroner Mark Armitage said he was
OL,8,Fadjourning the inquest to "await
OL,9,Fongoing investigations".
